@anon.863986d00e4103fb69f29fe2b65b0919.793 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [1016 x i8] }> <{ [1016 x i8] c"A horizontal line in the table.\0A\0AOverrides any per-cell stroke, including stroke specified through the\0Atable's `stroke` field. Can cross spacing between cells created through the\0Atable's [`column-gutter`]($table.column-gutter) option.\0A\0AUse this function instead of the table's `stroke` field if you want to\0Amanually place a horizontal line at a specific position in a single table.\0AConsider using [table's `stroke`]($table.stroke) field or [`table.cell`'s\0A`stroke`]($table.cell.stroke) field instead if the line you want to place is\0Apart of all your tables' designs.\0A\0A```example\0A#set table.hline(stroke: .6pt)\0A\0A#table(\0A  stroke: none,\0A  columns: (auto, 1fr),\0A  [09:00], [Badge pick up],\0A  [09:45], [Opening Keynote],\0A  [10:30], [Talk: Typst's Future],\0A  [11:15], [Session: Good PRs],\0A  table.hline(start: 1),\0A  [Noon], [_Lunch break_],\0A  table.hline(start: 1),\0A  [14:00], [Talk: Tracked Layout],\0A  [15:00], [Talk: Automations],\0A  [16:00], [Workshop: Tables],\0A  table.hline(),\0A  [19:00], [Day 1 Attendee Mixer],\0A)\0A```" }>, align 1
